WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,880
But what’s the matter with Jiuquan always being Qilin’s backing?

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:05,660
Feng Yi did ask me to go back

3
00:00:05,820 --> 00:00:06,860
Just wait here

4
00:00:07,020 --> 00:00:08,860
When that little girl wakes up, remember to send me a message.

5
00:00:11,610 --> 00:00:13,290
You care about that young master who is too harmonious

6
00:00:13,450 --> 00:00:15,290
He is a social commander with great potential, come to think of it

7
00:00:15,530 --> 00:00:17,410
Your Wang Tian is also different. He is interested in him.

8
00:00:17,410 --> 00:00:19,930
It's also interesting to be interested in the mecha he designed.

9
00:00:19,930 --> 00:00:21,010
I don’t have time to chat more.

10
00:00:21,410 --> 00:00:23,010
He looks a bit like me when I was young

11
00:00:23,410 --> 00:00:25,450
Patrols gather at the junction of mountains and desert

12
00:00:25,450 --> 00:00:28,330
Commander Gao Jie said that he discovered Chongzu

13
00:00:28,410 --> 00:00:30,130
They have evolved to be like humans

14
00:00:30,290 --> 00:00:31,250
So disgusting

15
00:00:32,140 --> 00:00:33,780
I don’t know how long the federation can be stable.

16
00:00:34,220 --> 00:00:35,260
this is our mission

17
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:48,570
What's going on? It's okay.

18
00:00:48,770 --> 00:00:50,810
Congratulations on your spiritual promotion to level A
